SUMMARY:Dormition panigiri of Panagia Kanala
LOCATION:Kanala\, Kythnos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The island's patroness\, whose icon was found floating in the channel between Kythnos and Serifos\, draws pilgrims from all over the Aegean: vespers on 14 August at the pine-shaded shrine above Kanala beach\, an all-night glenti with violin and laouto\, and on the 15th a liturgy and a re-enactment of the icon's finding with a procession down to the little harbour. Rooms in Kanala sell out weeks ahead\; most people stay in Dryopida or Chora and drive over.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/kythnos/#kanala-dormition-panigiri-of-panagia-kanala
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/kythnos/#kanala-dormition-panigiri-of-panagia-kanala
END:VEVENT
